<div class="blurb">
<div class="header"><h1>site news archive</h1></div>
<div class="body">

<div class="blurb">
<h3>June 15, 2015</h3>
<p>Fixed a bug in the mantra summary that did not set the 'returnto' correctly</p>
</div>

<div class="blurb">
  <h3>July 1, 2015</h3>
  <p>working on <a href="{$smarty.const.SOPHIAURL}">sophia (blog/forum)</a></p>
</div>

<div class="blurb">
<h3>June 29, 2015</h3>
<ul>
<li>Fixed several bugs in the <a href="{$smarty.const.REPOURL}">software repo</a> that would allow any file, even if hidden, to be downloaded/viewed.</li>
<li>Fixed a bug in displayerrorpage() that was not correctly setting the http result code. That meant that for an error that was supposed to be a 403, a 200 was returned. a <a href="http://php.net/manual/en/function.http-response-code.php#116539">comment on php.net regarding the http_response_code function</a> was the major inspiration behind this fix.<//li>
</ul>
</div>

<div class="blurb">
<h3>May 6, 2015</h3>
<ul>
<li> added use of the "<a href="https://css-tricks.com/almanac/properties/t/transition/">transition</a>" css3 property to the "A" tags on zoidtechnologies.com by adding a few lines to zoidweb2.css.</li>
<li> hacked a glitch in the digital clock when using chrome. The hack was to use a ":" and a "!" instead of using &amp;nbsp;</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="blurb">
<h3>March 25, 2015</h3>
<ul>
<li> updated <a href="{$smarty.const.ACHILLESURL}">Achilles</a> with a new link plus a couple of notes.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="blurb">
<h3>December, 2014</h3>
<ul>
<li>new feature: added light use of <a href="http://fortawesome.github.io/Font-Awesome/">Font Awesome</a></li>
<li>new page: <a href="/moneyday">moneyday</a>, a script to calculate the next disbursement date for social security recipients</li>
<li>bug fix: last login date is now properly handled. getlastlogin() and setlastlogin() have been added to the engine.</li>
</ul>
</div>
