<li>new feature: change password</li>
<li>enhancement: broken links on Vulcan are now sorted to the bottom (new links blurb, links on teos, etc)</li>
<li>enhancement: to accomodate mobile platforms, entering a handle into the login form is case insensitive</li>
</ul>
</div>
